{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1403999-scion-2e-kickstarter-questions","id":1403999,"title":"Scion 2e Kickstarter Questions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-07-22T06:45:57-07:00","id":1403999,"title":"Scion 2e Kickstarter Questions","content":"Is there a list of upcoming Kickstarter projects for the Scion game lines which is viewable by the public?<br /> <br /> <br /> I'm hoping for something along the lines of the names of the books, in an order their Kickstarters are expected to run, and a rough time frame those campaigns are expected to take place.<br /> <br /> <br /> I'd love to be able to set reminders for when to expect a campaign is going to run on the books/games which interest me, and in these peri-apocalyptic times it would be nice to be able to budget funds for Kickstarter campaign support.<br /> <br /> <br /> If such a list doesn't exist, why doesn't it? <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2587-zen_hydra","name":"Zen_Hydra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2587_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-22T07:07:59-07:00","id":1404012,"title":"","content":"See my response to your post under Trinity for the link to the upcoming books. Scion: Dragon and Scion: Mythos are the next two books being Kickstarted next. We'll have Demigod after those, probably. Then after that God will be coming, but there may be books between Demigod and God.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-22T07:08:36-07:00","id":1404013,"title":"","content":"Not really possible in this case: we know which books are currently slated for Kickstarters, but they're considering whether to do them as separate KSes or together as one KS - so until that's sorted out, we don't even know if there is an order. As for time frame... not in months, but in terms of other KSes, it/they'll come after They Came From Beyond The Grave! and WoD Ghost Hunters, and maybe after Trinity Continuum: Adventure!<br /> <br /> Anyway. Books currently slated for Kickstarters:<br /> Demigod<br /> Masks of the Mythos<br /> Dragon","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-22T07:12:39-07:00","id":1404015,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Florin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1403999-scion-2e-kickstarter-questions?p=1404012#post1404012\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">See my response to your post under Trinity for the link to the upcoming books. Scion: Dragon and Scion: Mythos are the next two books being Kickstarted next. We'll have Demigod after those, probably. Then after that God will be coming, but there may be books between Demigod and God.</div> </div> </div> </div>Looking at their current progress in the Monday Meeting notes, it looks like Demigod is ahead of Dragon and Masks of the Mythos in that regard, as it's the one with KS art in progress.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-23T05:15:36-07:00","id":1404224,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zen_Hydra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1403999-scion-2e-kickstarter-questions#post1403999\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> If such a list doesn't exist, why doesn't it?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'll respond here (though it applies to all three of your threads on this same topic).<br /> <br /> It doesn't exist because Onyx Path (as they're told us a few times) keeps things flexible. They weigh multiple factors regarding upcoming books on whether they'll get a Kickstarter, and when. If they have 2-3 books in the works that they've designated as getting a Kickstarter, they don't want to lock in an order in case something gets delayed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-30T21:12:07-07:00","id":1405462,"title":"","content":"Do we have any idea how close we are to Companion?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24323-zipdrive","name":"ZipDrive","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-30T22:44:44-07:00","id":1405473,"title":"","content":"In today's What's Up With Onyx Path stream Rich showed off a printed copy that had just arrived. Should be for sale sometime soon after he's had a chance to make sure nothing hinky happened with the printing process.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3776-autodefenestrate","name":"AutoDefenestrate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3776_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"120"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}